# Games isolation

`/games` is a standalone speed-typing slice. Keep it easy to delete.

## Put Games code only in
- `games/` (routes, views, db, sql, public, revert)
- the marked `GAMES-BEGIN` / `GAMES-END` blocks in `server/server.js`
- `"games/**"` in `vercel.json` includeFiles
- `.cursor/rules/games.mdc` (this file)

## Product
- Public URL: `https://www.tademehl.com/games`
- 45-second English speed-typing sprint
- Score: `max(0, round(WPM × 10) − (mistakes × 20))`
- Table is `games_highscore` only

## Do not
- Import diary, admin, or `server/db/supabase.js` from Games
- Add Games links, buttons, or data to other pages
- Put Games styles in `public/css/style.css`
- Share tables with the rest of the site
- Add `/games` to the sitemap

## Revert
```bash
node games/revert-games.js
```
See `games/REVERT.md`. Then delete `games/` and run `games/sql/drop.sql` in Supabase.
